          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="about_report_title_label">
            <property name="font">
             <font>
              <bold>true</bold>
             </font>
            </property>
            <property name="text">
             <string>About the report</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="about_report_label">
            <property name="text">
             <string>The oxygen saturation is analyzed during the sleep period, from the first epoch scored as sleep (N1, N2, N3 or R) to the final awakening (including the last epoch scored as sleep). Automatic artefact detection is applied to the oximeter channel: the artefacts longer than 5 s are excluded from the analysis, the shorter ones are interpolated. The report has three categories of variables:</string>
            </property>
            <property name="wordWrap">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
            <property name="variant" stdset="0">
             <string notr="true">help</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="variables_layout" stretch="1,1,1">
            <property name="spacing">
             <number>16</number>
            </property>
            <item>
             <widget class="QLabel" name="saturation_label">
              <property name="text">
               <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Oxygen saturation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• minimum, maximum, mean and variability (standard deviation)&lt;br/&gt;• percentage of time below 96% to 60%&lt;br/&gt;Metrics are computed for the entire sleep period, and stratified by sleep thirds and halves, the sleep cycles and the sleep stages (W, N1, N2, N3, REM, NREM, N2–N3 and total sleep).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
              </property>
              <property name="textFormat">
               <enum>Qt::TextFormat::RichText</enum>
              </property>
              <property name="alignment">
               <set>Qt::AlignmentFlag::AlignLeading|Qt::AlignmentFlag::AlignLeft|Qt::AlignmentFlag::AlignTop</set>
              </property>
              <property name="wordWrap">
               <bool>true</bool>
              </property>
              <property name="variant" stdset="0">
               <string notr="true">help</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QLabel" name="desaturation_label">
              <property name="text">
               <string>&lt;b&gt;Oxygen desaturations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• number of events&lt;br/&gt;• index (ODI, events per hour)&lt;br/&gt;• severity: sum of the areas of the events (%·s) over the sleep period&lt;br/&gt;• percentage of sleep time in desaturation&lt;br/&gt;• average and median duration (s), area (%·s), slope (%/s) and drop (%)</string>
              </property>
              <property name="textFormat">
               <enum>Qt::TextFormat::RichText</enum>
              </property>
              <property name="alignment">
               <set>Qt::AlignmentFlag::AlignLeading|Qt::AlignmentFlag::AlignLeft|Qt::AlignmentFlag::AlignTop</set>
              </property>
              <property name="wordWrap">
               <bool>true</bool>
              </property>
              <property name="variant" stdset="0">
               <string notr="true">help</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QLabel" name="recovery_label">
              <property name="text">
               <string>&lt;b&gt;Oxygen recoveries&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• number of events&lt;br/&gt;• index (events per hour)&lt;br/&gt;• severity: sum of the areas of the events (%·s) over the sleep period&lt;br/&gt;• percentage of sleep time in recovery&lt;br/&gt;• average and median duration (s), area (%·s), slope (%/s) and amplitude (%)</string>
              </property>
              <property name="textFormat">
               <enum>Qt::TextFormat::RichText</enum>
              </property>
              <property name="alignment">
               <set>Qt::AlignmentFlag::AlignLeading|Qt::AlignmentFlag::AlignLeft|Qt::AlignmentFlag::AlignTop</set>
              </property>
              <property name="wordWrap">
               <bool>true</bool>
              </property>
              <property name="variant" stdset="0">
               <string notr="true">help</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
           </layout>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="about_report_end_label">
            <property name="text">
             <string>The total severity is the sum of the areas of the desaturations and the recoveries (%·s) over the valid sleep period (s). The characteristics of each event (file of each recording) are its start time (s), duration (s), slope (%/s), depth (%) and area (%·s). The graph shows the saturation signal of the whole recording, with the invalid sections highlighted.</string>
            </property>
            <property name="wordWrap">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
            <property name="variant" stdset="0">
             <string notr="true">help</string>
            </property>
